    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dA dragon survivor, a rarity in these times.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what she called herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a \u201cMonster Monger\u201d that controls a band of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maid who is not a monster, but a follower of the monster shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there is the person who claims to be a \u201cdragon survivor,\u201d whom the protagonist meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a mysterious and bizarre tale that unfolds in a retro-futuristic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based novel game with point-and-click exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is deeply influenced by both novels and movies, and contains many cinematic effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty level is fairly low, and the game is almost a one-step novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of endings: 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Translated with  (free version)</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dA dragon survivor, a rarity in these times.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's what she called herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a \u201cMonster Monger\u201d that controls a band of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maid who is not a monster, but a follower of the monster shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there is the person who claims to be a \u201cdragon survivor,\u201d whom the protagonist meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a mysterious and bizarre tale that unfolds in a retro-futuristic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A text-based novel game with point-and-click exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is deeply influenced by both novels and movies, and contains many cinematic effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty level is fairly low, and the game is almost a one-step novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of endings: 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Translated with  (free version)</i></p>",
